abstract: "Research software, frozen protocols and numerical evidence for a study of temporal pooling observation boundaries and loss dependent risk rankings: exact finite-state risk algebra with uniform margins, a target-noise bound and a support-perturbation counterexample; a frozen 325-fit neural protocol with per-seed scores, paired contrasts, frozen draws and fitted checkpoints; and executed verification records. The manuscript, supplementary document, cover letter and AI-use statement are not included, and provider electricity files are not redistributed."
